        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>每日安排与每月安排</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 22px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n\n  h2.section {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 6px 0 18px 0;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 12%, #ffe9a8 12%, #ffe9a8 92%, transparent 92%);\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n\n  .hl-pink {\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 12%, #ffd9d6 12%, #ffd9d6 92%, transparent 92%);\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n\n  table.schedule {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 92%;\n    margin: 0 auto 34px auto;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  table.schedule td {\n    border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  table.schedule td.time {\n    background: #fdf6dc;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    width: 40%;\n  }\n\n  table.schedule td.subject {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    width: 14%;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  table.schedule td.note {\n    width: 46%;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n\n  .bold {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .red-bold {\n    color: #e8342a;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .block-tight p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .spacer {\n    height: 16px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\"><span class=\"hl-yellow\">一、每日安排</span></h2>\n\n  <table class=\"schedule\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"time\">08:30-12:30(4h)</td>\n      <td class=\"subject\">数学</td>\n      <td class=\"note\">最清醒的时间留给数学<br>是对数学最大的尊重🙇</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"time\">14:30-18:00(3.5h)</td>\n      <td class=\"subject\">逻辑</td>\n      <td class=\"note\">下午学逻辑记得要午休<br>不然容易犯困的～</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"time\">19:00-20:30(1.5h)</td>\n      <td class=\"subject\">英语</td>\n      <td class=\"note\">详见下文每日安排</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"time\">20:30-22:00(1.5h)</td>\n      <td class=\"subject\">写作</td>\n      <td class=\"note\">详见下文每月安排</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"time\">22:30-23:00(0.5h)</td>\n      <td class=\"subject\">单词</td>\n      <td class=\"note\">每日背100新词+复习旧单词<br>下文每月计划中不再赘述</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\"><span class=\"hl-yellow\">二、每月安排一全程无广 有广找不到工作</span>🤧</h2>\n\n  <p>在工作闲暇时间前，我花了一个月的时间参考上岸学长姐的备考资料及经验，总结出了自己的备考计划</p>\n\n  <div class=\"block-tight\">\n    <p class=\"bold\">不推荐大家照抄任何一个人的备考计划！！</p>\n    <p class=\"bold\">不推荐大家照抄任何一个人的备考计划！！</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n  <p>看备考计划的价值在于思考：<span class=\"red-bold\">TA能上岸的关键是什么</span>，在这之后才是：那本书 / 那节课 / 那个老师好不好；</p>\n  <p>今天先教大家一招：<span class=\"bold\">找不同</span>，找到高分经验贴中最不相同的经验，那可能就是TA的秘诀；</p>\n  <p>我也希望大家可以<span class=\"bold\">带着这个问题读完我的经验贴</span>，同时在之后的笔记，我会揭晓这个问题的答案～</p>\n  <p>最后：千人千面，试听后不适合就换老师，开始学才是最重要的!</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
